# GitHub Actions Node.js runtime + secret safety

Before committing workflow changes:

1. Scan every `uses:` entry for Node.js 20 runtimes.
2. Upgrade to Node.js 24+ releases.
3. Prefer `actions/checkout@v7`, `setup-node@v7`, `upload-artifact@v7`, `download-artifact@v8`.
4. Run `npm run lint:actions-secrets` before commit.

## Secrets in workflow logs (non-negotiable)

Follow `never-echo-secrets.mdc`. Never pass PEMs via action `with:` inputs. Never echo `"::add-mask::$MULTILINE_VAR"` for PEMs. Rotate immediately if leaked.
